arks and \"Add to Home Screen\" — without it the icon falls back to a screenshot."},{"id":"manifest-parsed","label":"Manifest fetched and parsed successfully","status":"n/a","evidence":"No manifest declared","exampleUrl":"https://www.cms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/lcd.aspx?bc=7&contractorName=all&contractorNumber=all&lcdid=33444&lcdStatus=all&sortBy=title&ver=42","why":"A manifest that fails to parse cannot drive installability or launch behavior even if the link is present."},{"id":"manifest-maskable-icon","label":"Manifest declares a maskable icon","status":"n/a","evidence":"No manifest declared","exampleUrl":"https://www.cms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/lcd.aspx?bc=7&contractorName=all&contractorNumber=all&lcdid=33444&lcdStatus=all&sortBy=title&ver=42","why":"A maskable icon lets the OS safely crop/mask the app icon on different device shapes without clipping content."},{"id":"sw-active","label":"Service worker is active (not just registered)","status":"fail","evidence":"","exampleUrl":"https://www.cms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/lcd.aspx?bc=7&contractorName=all&contractorNumber=all&lcdid=33444&lcdStatus=all&sortBy=title&ver=42","why":"An active service worker (not just registered) is what actually intercepts requests and serves cached content."},{"id":"sw-controlling","label":"Service worker controls this page load","status":"fail","evidence":"","exampleUrl":"https://www.cms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/lcd.aspx?bc=7&contractorName=all&contractorNumber=all&lcdid=33444&lcdStatus=all&sortBy=title&ver=42","why":"A controlling service worker means THIS page load is being served/intercepted, not just a future one."},{"id":"installable","label":"Meets basic installability criteria","status":"fail","evidence":"no readable web app manifest; no service worker registered","exampleUrl":"https://www.cms.gov/medicare-coverage-database/view/lcd.aspx?bc=7&contractorName=all&contractorNumber=all&lcdid=33444&lcdStatus=all&sortBy=title&ver=42","why"